<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We display here (Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.2 T-Test of the Separation Between the Original and Obfuscated Prompts ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Broken-Token: Filtering Obfuscated Prompts by Counting Characters-Per-Token" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>) the results of t-statistics and p-values for all comparison between the original and obfuscated prompts,
